  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math> be real numbers satisfying the equations&nbsp;<br />\r<math><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math><br />\r<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math><br />\r<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where<br />\r<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math> are not all zero, then the number of the possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;are not all zero, thus the system has a non-trivial solution.<br />Thus,&nbsp;<math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
